Package: flexsynth
Type: Package
Title: Flexible Synthetic Data for Nested, Longitudinal and Linked Multi-Table Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Yee How", family = "Lau",
    email = "lauyeehow1986@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generates high-quality synthetic data from real datasets of any
    structure, with native long-format support for nested, longitudinal and
    multi-table linked data (for example patients, admissions, procedures and
    labs linked by identifiers). A high-utility sequential-synthesis engine is
    the default; an opt-in differentially private track provides a formal
    (epsilon, delta) guarantee at person level for governed data release.
    Synthetic output is not anonymisation: honest disclosure-risk diagnostics
    are provided so residual risk can be judged.
